OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 20 MAY
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GElizabeth Alker introduces an
OL,6,     Gafternoon of specially made
OL,7,     Grecordings including orchestral
OL,8,     Gworks from the Berlin
OL,9,     GPhilharmonic and chamber music
OL,10,     Gled by Sir Antonio Pappano.
OL,11,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,12,     GFrom St Paul's Church
OL,13,     GKnightsbridge, London, with the
OL,14,     GBBC Singers, with music by Lucy
OL,15,     GWalker and Cheryl Frances Hoad.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Palestrina
OL,17,     GPalestrina is employed by popes
OL,18,     Gand princes, with his fame
OL,19,     Gspreading beyond Rome: Donald
OL,20,     GMacleod sees how he is now
OL,21,     Gworking on the reformation of
OL,22,     Gmusic after the Council of Trent.
